### 2. Massive Code Duplication

**Event lookup pattern** — repeated 20+ times across files:
```js
const event = await prisma.event.findFirst({
  where: { OR: [{ id: eventId }, { eventId }] },
});
if (!event) throw new NotFoundError('Event not found');
```
Found in: [event.service.js](file:///c:/Users/anwee/Desktop_1/Learning-Season/SGT_1v/Sgt-Ums/backend/src/modules/event-management/services/event.service.js) (×5), [team.service.js](file:///c:/Users/anwee/Desktop_1/Learning-Season/SGT_1v/Sgt-Ums/backend/src/modules/event-management/services/team.service.js) (×6), [payment.service.js](file:///c:/Users/anwee/Desktop_1/Learning-Season/SGT_1v/Sgt-Ums/backend/src/modules/event-management/services/payment.service.js) (×4), [stall.controller.js](file:///c:/Users/anwee/Desktop_1/Learning-Season/SGT_1v/Sgt-Ums/backend/src/modules/event-management/controllers/stall.controller.js) (×5), [coupon.service.js](file:///c:/Users/anwee/Desktop_1/Learning-Season/SGT_1v/Sgt-Ums/backend/src/modules/event-management/services/coupon.service.js) (×4), [registration.service.js](file:///c:/Users/anwee/Desktop_1/Learning-Season/SGT_1v/Sgt-Ums/backend/src/modules/event-management/services/registration.service.js) (×2).

**Recommendation:** The [getEventLean](file:///c:/Users/anwee/Desktop_1/Learning-Season/SGT_1v/Sgt-Ums/backend/src/modules/event-management/utils/eventHelpers.js#70-90) helper in [eventHelpers.js](file:///c:/Users/anwee/Desktop_1/Learning-Season/SGT_1v/Sgt-Ums/backend/src/modules/event-management/utils/eventHelpers.js) already exists for this — but most code **doesn't use it**.

**Coupon finalization** — copy-pasted 3 times in [payment.service.js](file:///c:/Users/anwee/Desktop_1/Learning-Season/SGT_1v/Sgt-Ums/backend/src/modules/event-management/services/payment.service.js):
```js
if (reg?.couponId) {
  await finalizeCouponUsage(tx, reg.couponId, payment.registrationId, reg.userId, reg.originalAmount);
