Appears in [verifyIndividualPayment](file:///c:/Users/anwee/Desktop_1/Learning-Season/SGT_1v/Sgt-Ums/backend/src/modules/event-management/services/payment.service.js#184-265), [verifyTeamPayment](file:///c:/Users/anwee/Desktop_1/Learning-Season/SGT_1v/Sgt-Ums/backend/src/modules/event-management/services/payment.service.js#506-609), and [handleWebhook](file:///c:/Users/anwee/Desktop_1/Learning-Season/SGT_1v/Sgt-Ums/backend/src/modules/event-management/services/payment.service.js#614-768).

**Team ID resolution** — UUID vs string ID check duplicated:
