const isUUID = /^[0-9a-f]{8}-[0-9a-f]{4}-...$/i.test(teamId);
```
Found in [payment.service.js](file:///c:/Users/anwee/Desktop_1/Learning-Season/SGT_1v/Sgt-Ums/backend/src/modules/event-management/services/payment.service.js) lines 313 and 547.

