| Criterion | Status | Details |
|-----------|--------|---------|
| Pure functions | ✅ Partial | [computeDiscount](file:///c:/Users/anwee/Desktop_1/Learning-Season/SGT_1v/Sgt-Ums/backend/src/modules/event-management/services/coupon.service.js#11-41), [toPaise](file:///c:/Users/anwee/Desktop_1/Learning-Season/SGT_1v/Sgt-Ums/backend/src/modules/event-management/services/payment.service.js#48-52), [generateQRCode](file:///c:/Users/anwee/Desktop_1/Learning-Season/SGT_1v/Sgt-Ums/backend/src/modules/event-management/utils/qrCodeGenerator.js#10-24), [sanitizeHtml](file:///c:/Users/anwee/Desktop_1/Learning-Season/SGT_1v/Sgt-Ums/backend/src/shared/utils/validators.js#26-41), [sanitizeSponsors](file:///c:/Users/anwee/Desktop_1/Learning-Season/SGT_1v/Sgt-Ums/backend/src/shared/utils/validators.js#42-63) — testable |
| Service isolation | ❌ | All services import [prisma](file:///c:/Users/anwee/Desktop_1/Learning-Season/SGT_1v/Sgt-Ums/chema%20loaded%20from%20prismaschema.prisma) directly — impossible to unit test without mocking the module system |
| Controller-service boundary | ✅ Partial | Controllers delegate to services — good separation for integration tests |
| Mock-friendly DI | ❌ | No dependency injection — [require()](file:///c:/Users/anwee/Desktop_1/Learning-Season/SGT_1v/Sgt-Ums/backend/src/shared/middleware/auth.js#251-314) coupling everywhere |
| Existing tests | ❌ | **Zero test files found** — no `__tests__`, no `.test.js`, no `.spec.js` |
| Side-effect-free functions | ✅ Partial | [formatEventResponse](file:///c:/Users/anwee/Desktop_1/Learning-Season/SGT_1v/Sgt-Ums/backend/src/modules/event-management/utils/eventHelpers.js#369-481), [resolveSponsorData](file:///c:/Users/anwee/Desktop_1/Learning-Season/SGT_1v/Sgt-Ums/backend/src/modules/event-management/utils/eventHelpers.js#270-303), [resolveResourceData](file:///c:/Users/anwee/Desktop_1/Learning-Season/SGT_1v/Sgt-Ums/backend/src/modules/event-management/utils/eventHelpers.js#304-351) — pure, testable |

> [!CAUTION]
> **Zero automated tests exist.** For a system handling payments (Razorpay), user data, and university events for 25k users, this is a **critical risk**. A single untested refactor could break payment flows or duplicate charges.

