## 🧹 DRY / KISS Assessment: **55/100**

### DRY Violations

1. **Event resolution** (`findFirst` with `OR: [{ id }, { eventId }]`) — duplicated 20+ times instead of using [getEventLean](file:///c:/Users/anwee/Desktop_1/Learning-Season/SGT_1v/Sgt-Ums/backend/src/modules/event-management/utils/eventHelpers.js#70-90)
2. **Permission checking** — [checkPermission](file:///c:/Users/anwee/Desktop_1/Learning-Season/SGT_1v/Sgt-Ums/backend/src/shared/middleware/auth.js#503-601) and [checkAnyPermission](file:///c:/Users/anwee/Desktop_1/Learning-Season/SGT_1v/Sgt-Ums/backend/src/shared/middleware/auth.js#602-694) share ~80% identical code, with the chairperson check copy-pasted between them
3. **[checkIprFilePermission](file:///c:/Users/anwee/Desktop_1/Learning-Season/SGT_1v/Sgt-Ums/backend/src/shared/middleware/auth.js#378-440) and [checkResearchFilePermission](file:///c:/Users/anwee/Desktop_1/Learning-Season/SGT_1v/Sgt-Ums/backend/src/shared/middleware/auth.js#441-495)** in [auth.js](file:///c:/Users/anwee/Desktop_1/Learning-Season/SGT_1v/Sgt-Ums/backend/src/shared/middleware/auth.js) — nearly identical functions (~50 lines each) that differ only in permission names and error messages. Should be a single parameterized function.
4. **UUID detection regex** — duplicated in [payment.service.js](file:///c:/Users/anwee/Desktop_1/Learning-Season/SGT_1v/Sgt-Ums/backend/src/modules/event-management/services/payment.service.js) lines 313 and 547
5. **Formatting patterns** — `profile?.displayName || \`${profile?.firstName} ${profile?.lastName}\`.trim()` appears in 4+ locations

### KISS Violations

1. **Registration status re-export chain:** [event.constants.js](file:///c:/Users/anwee/Desktop_1/Learning-Season/SGT_1v/Sgt-Ums/backend/src/modules/event-management/constants/event.constants.js) → imported by [registration.service.js](file:///c:/Users/anwee/Desktop_1/Learning-Season/SGT_1v/Sgt-Ums/backend/src/modules/event-management/services/registration.service.js) → re-exported → imported by [payment.service.js](file:///c:/Users/anwee/Desktop_1/Learning-Season/SGT_1v/Sgt-Ums/backend/src/modules/event-management/services/payment.service.js). Just import from constants directly.
2. **[formatEventResponse](file:///c:/Users/anwee/Desktop_1/Learning-Season/SGT_1v/Sgt-Ums/backend/src/modules/event-management/utils/eventHelpers.js#369-481)** at 103 lines manually maps 50+ fields. A simpler approach: allow-list with spread operator or schema-driven serialization.

